{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34147","headline":"次追和清远道士诗韵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"次追和清远道士诗韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一代先後贤，声容剧河汉。\n况兹迈古士，复历苍崖窜。\n辰经几十万，邈与灵寿翫。\n海岳尚推移，都鄙固芜漫。\n羸僧下高阁，独鸟没远岸。\n啸初风雨来，吟余钟呗乱。\n如何链精魄，万祀忽欲半。\n宁爲断臂忧，肯作秋柏散。\n吾闻酆宫内，日月自昏旦。\n左右修文郎，纵横洒篇翰。\n斯人久冥漠，得不垂慨叹。\n庶或有神交，相从重兴赞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}